  "instructions": [
    "Grate the sweet potatoes and set aside.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together the flour, nuka-pickle, sea salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the grated carrot and apple to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Add the vegan butter, sugar, and plant-based milk to the bowl and mix until a thick batter forms.",
    "Heat a non-stick pan over medium heat.",
    "Drop the batter by 1/4 cupfuls onto the pan and cook for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Flip the pancakes and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "Serve the pancakes warm with your favorite toppings."
